From 8041b4565efa4ea5e21f28765d90990c0c4bbb7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ethan_liu <eveflyhigh12345@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:14:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] S3: enforce limit policies on tool calls

LimitEnforcer (injectable clock, per-tool and per-session state; a changed
policy starts a fresh history), session_scope_key() in tools/tool_manager.py
(connection-based, None on the stateless 2026-07-28 protocol), the pre-call
check in ToolManager.call_tool with the exact ToolError messages, recording
at completion time only after a normal non-InputRequiredResult return,
remove_tool resetting the budget, and limits= on MCPServer.tool() and
MCPServer.add_tool().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
